Third-party components
----------------------

fury-shared (tools/fury-config depends on it; linked into the fury-config helper)
  https://github.com/furyteamtop/fury-antidetect-browser, directory shared-rs
  Copyright The Fury Authors. License: AGPL-3.0-or-later.
  Pinned to commit 2c572eb0a02939e01c3992870c9ca84f93145348 (release v0.3.5).
  Its persona catalogue data (directory shared/) is Apache-2.0.

Fury core (downloaded at runtime, never redistributed by AnyProfile)
  https://github.com/furyteamtop/fury-antidetect-browser/releases
  A patched Chromium. Fury's patches: BSD-3-Clause. Chromium: BSD-3-Clause and
  the licenses of its third-party components. AnyProfile downloads the
  notarized release, verifies its SHA-256 and Apple signature, and executes it
  unmodified.

Apostate (downloaded at runtime, never redistributed by AnyProfile)
  https://github.com/heretic-tech/apostate/releases
  A patched Chromium. License: GPL-3.0. Chromium: BSD-3-Clause and the
  licenses of its third-party components. AnyProfile downloads the notarized
  release, verifies its SHA-256 and Apple signature (team PX3P7V373K), and
  executes it unmodified as a separate program.

Widevine CDM
  Not shipped. When Google Chrome is installed, AnyProfile copies the user's own
  licensed CDM from the Chrome bundle into each profile on that same machine,
  as the Fury agent does.

AliasMode design tokens
  frontend/src/styles/tokens.css adapts the palette, type scale and elevation
  recipe of the AliasMode dashboard (https://github.com/aliasmode/aliasmode,
  web/styles.css, commit 56c18f9). Copyright AliasMode authors.
  License: Apache-2.0. No AliasMode source code is included.
  Language catalog layout with English fallback, inspired by
  aliasmode/aliasmode web/i18n.tsx (Apache-2.0); no code copied.
  Start pages per platform, inspired by aliasmode/aliasmode launcher.ts
  platformHomeUrl (Apache-2.0); no code copied.
  Per-profile authenticator codes, inspired by aliasmode/aliasmode totp.ts
  (Apache-2.0); no code copied.

Hidemyacc workflow
  Bulk creation, duplication, start pages and new-profile defaults follow the
  workflow described in Hidemyacc's public documentation
  (docs.hidemyacc.com); no code or assets used.

Fingerprint capture
  Fingerprint capture and comparison at launch, inspired by aliasmode/aliasmode
  fingerprint-capture.ts and fingerprint-attestation.ts (Apache-2.0); no code
  copied.

Simple Icons
  Brand icon paths in frontend/src/sites/icons.gen.ts come from simple-icons
  16.35.0 (https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons), CC0-1.0. Brand marks
  belong to their owners and only identify a platform.

